Package: jobR
Type: Package
Title: Fully manage distribution of embarrasingly parallel tasks
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Jared Norman
Maintainer: Jared Norman <jarednorman@hotmail.com>
Description: Given a function needs to map many jobs, a plumberAPI based
    server handles management of parameter sets being sent to one or more
    clients which process these through a function and return the result.
    The server stores the results and makes them available once complete.
